# Revisions that only reformat YAML — no content change.
#
# These commits re-emit data YAMLs through their own family's serializer
# (scripts/lib/yaml_io.py) to drive the round-trip residual to zero, so that
# the NEXT structural edit to those files shows only what its author changed.
# They move sequence indentation, scalar fold points and continuation-line
# indentation; parsed content is byte-identical and the rendered site hash is
# unchanged.
#
# GitHub honours this file automatically. Locally, enable it once with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
